  "description": "Silverback is a powerful, elegant, and feature-rich message bus for .NET, designed to simplify asynchronous messaging, event-driven architectures, and microservice communication. With seamless integration for Apache Kafka and MQTT, it offers robust features for reliability, consistency, and scalability. This package contains the legacy IMessageSerializer based on Newtonsoft.Json.",
